@startuml FHIR_Henvisning_Use_Cases
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #F2F4F7
skinparam defaultFontName IBM Plex Sans
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #EEEAF7
  BorderColor #4B3F8A
  FontColor #4B3F8A
}

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #E6F4F6
  BorderColor #1A7F8E
  FontColor #1A7F8E
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FBF0EB
  BorderColor #C75D3A
  FontColor #3D4E63
}

title FHIR-baseret Henvisningshåndtering — Overordnet flow

actor      "Henviser"   as H
participant "FHIR Server" as S
actor      "Visitator"  as V

== Sektion 1 · Henviser ==

H  ->  S : **1.1** POST Bundle\n//ServiceRequest// status=proposed
S  ->  V : Bundle videresendt
V  ->  H : ACK (teknisk kvittering)

note over H
  **1.2** Tilknytte dokumentation
  DiagnosticReport / Media /
  DocumentReference → ServiceRequest
end note

H  ->  S : **1.3** PUT ServiceRequest (revision-flag)
note right of S : Visitator notificeres\nom opdatering

H  ->  S : **1.4** PUT ServiceRequest status=revoked
note right of S : Flowet afsluttes

H  ->  S : **1.5** Subscription / poll
S  ->  H : SubscriptionStatus (push/poll svar)

S  ->  H : **1.6** Task / SubscriptionNotification\n(accept, afvisning eller alternativ)

== Sektion 2 · Visitator ==

V  ->  V : **2.1** Modtag Bundle + ServiceRequest\nSend ACK → system
V  ->  V : **2.2** Opret Task (triage-outcome, priority)

alt Acceptere
  V  ->  S : **2.3** PUT ServiceRequest status=active\nOpret Appointment
  S  ->  H : SubscriptionNotification (accept + booking)
else Afvise
  V  ->  S : **2.4** PUT ServiceRequest status=revoked\nOpret Task (rejection + begrundelse)
  S  ->  H : SubscriptionNotification (afvisning)
else Videresende
  V  ->  S : **2.5** POST ServiceRequest (replaces → original)
  S  ->  V : Ny modtager modtager Bundle
end

V  ->  S : **2.6** PUT ServiceRequest (priority update)
S  ->  H : SubscriptionNotification (prioritetsændring)

== Sektion 3 · Udvekslingsdialog ==

V  ->  H : **3.1** POST CommunicationRequest\n(anmodning om supplement)
H  ->  V : **3.2** POST Communication (in-response-to)\n(besvarelse med kliniske data)

loop Faglig afklaring (n gange)
  H  ->  V : **3.3** Communication [odd] →
  V  ->  H : **3.3** ← Communication [even] in-response-to
end

V  ->  H : **3.4** SubscriptionNotification\n(statusskift: modtaget / under vurdering / afgørelse)

V  ->  H : **3.5** Communication (forslag om alternativ)
H  ->  V : Communication (svar / aftale)
V  ->  S : POST Task (alternativ aftale)

V  ->  H : **3.6** Communication (fejlbesked)
H  ->  V : Communication (korrektionsaftale)
H  ->  S : PUT ServiceRequest (korrigeret)

@enduml


